ta-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>To remove the logarithm, we exponentiate both sides of the equation. The base of the logarithm is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"43\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> so we use this base for the exponentiation as well:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"44\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 5.43em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mj