class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mn>8</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, since exponentiation is the inverse function of the logarithm, we get <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"45\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-m